# Trade Safety

## Execution pipeline (mandatory order)

1. GARP score via Rebalance-MCP
2. Constraint check against `portfolio/profile.yaml`
3. `wsli buy/sell --dry-run` → save to `research/reports/`
4. User explicit approval
5. Set `TRADE_APPROVED=true` for live execution only

## Paper trading gate

If `paper_trading_complete: false` in profile.yaml:
- **Block** all live wsli buy/sell
- Allow read-only sync and dry-run only
- Say: "Paper trading active — dry-run only."

## Rate limits

- Max 3 trades/hour, 5/day (profile.yaml)
- Wealthsimple server limit: 7/hour — never exceed 3/hour agent limit

## Position limits

- Max single stock: 20% of portfolio
- Max sector: 40%
- No margin, no options (until experience gate lifted)

## Kill switch

If `PAUSE_ALL_TRADING=true` — refuse all trade commands.

## Wealthsimple ToS

`wsli` is unofficial. User acknowledged `tos_acknowledged: true`. Remind on first live trade in a session.

## Drawdown

At 15% below peak — **no new buys**. Review-only mode until within 10% of peak.
